      "feature_id": null,
      "title": "Fix the failing Docker build and restore deployment",
      "summary": "The Docker build fails at `npm run build` because `tsc` reports a syntax error in `src/sideSnap.test.ts` (line 26). Several files also start with a stray `// FILE:` header line: `.dockerignore`, `.nvmrc`, `src/sideSnap.ts`, `src/snapping.ts`, `src/circleSnap.ts`, `src/hoverSide.ts`, `src/components/CursorPreview.tsx` and their tests. Remove these headers and fix the syntax error. Confirm that `npm ci && npm run build` passes locally, then redeploy. Without the `.dockerignore` fix, the ignore rules are not applied correctly and the image build context includes unwanted files. Without the `.nvmrc` fix, the Node version pin is invalid.",
      "detail": "{\"planState\":\"tasks_created\"}",
      "linked_element_ids": [],
      "finalized": false,
      "blocked_by": [],
      "notes": null,
      "created_at": "2026-10-27T08:38:30.532Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-10-27T08:41:10.063Z"
    },
