      "status": "not_started",
      "order": 1,
      "feature_id": null,
      "title": "Add build verification and clean up dependency vulnerabilities",
      "summary": "Run `npm test` and `tsc` in CI or a pre-deploy check so syntax and type errors are caught before the Docker image is built. Triage the 6 `npm audit` findings (2 critical, 1 high, 3 moderate), upgrading dev-only packages such as vite, vitest and jsdom where safe. Replace the deprecated `whatwg-encoding` dependency. Pin the Node version consistently across `.nvmrc`, `package.json` engines and the Dockerfile base image.",
      "detail": null,
